Subject: Preserve SPA pointer-string capabilities across plugin boundaries
Origin: Filnix
Upstream-Status: Not submitted

Route pointer-valued properties through one shared weak exact-pointer table.
The original owner retains lifetime responsibility; property strings neither
keep unreachable objects alive nor synthesize capabilities for unknown values.
Use the same interface for audio/video followers, DSP, JACK, Bluetooth and
custom thread creators. Native builds retain their existing pointer format.

